{"skill":{"slug":"writing-plans","displayName":"Writing Plans"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770691953645,"changelog":"Initial release: 编写计划","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3264,"sha256":"2046e5b955aa16c288f9c7290c58f237628dfb6ba6d4817fad3da0fa830b46c2","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1820,"sha256":"85a540cd1e85f7244f397bb639cfb4aa84566ce9e706ce76db0c4df2092208d3","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789056663425,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a75a74046f29de0a0f82db3605d516def7ed57e00663a65737a77c12491f601a","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a75a74046f29de0a0f82db3605d516def7ed57e00663a65737a77c12491f601a","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: writing-plans\nVersion: 0.1.0\n\nThe skill bundle is designed to instruct an AI agent on how to generate detailed implementation plans in markdown format. The `SKILL.md` file contains instructions for structuring the plan, including example code snippets and shell commands (e.g., `pytest`, `git`) that are intended to be *written into the plan*, not executed by the agent as part of this skill. The agent is instructed to save the generated plan to a local file path (`docs/plans/`), which is a benign operation. There are no instructions for data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, obfuscation, or prompt injection beyond guiding the agent's output formatting and suggesting legitimate follow-up skills (`superpowers:executing-plans`, `superpowers:subagent-driven-development`).","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779162659163},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":4,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789056663425},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a planning-only skill that tells the agent how to write detailed implementation plans, with no hidden code, network access, credential use, or automatic execution.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Saving a plan under docs/plans is proportionate to the planning purpose; example test, git, and commit commands are presented as plan content rather than automatic runtime actions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains only a Markdown SKILL.md file and no install scripts, executable payloads, dependencies, or remote retrieval instructions.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger language is broad and could apply to many multi-step planning situations, but the instructions remain planning-focused and do not override safety rules or hide unrelated behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill asks the agent to create a persistent plan document and may reference follow-on sub-skills if the user chooses execution, but it does not install services, modify agent memory, access credentials, or create background persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to create detailed implementation plans for multi-step coding work, and the artifact content is limited to plan structure, testing steps, file-path specificity, and handoff options.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want agents to produce very detailed implementation plans before coding. Expect it to write plan files under docs/plans and to suggest follow-on execution workflows; review those generated plans and execution choices before allowing code changes or commits.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The broad manifest trigger is a real scoping-quality note, but it is not supported by artifact evidence of hidden behavior, sensitive authority, or purpose-mismatched capability.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789056663425}}}}}